{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "note": [
    "Pinned model code and weights for the Milestone 2 pipeline. Verified before use by",
    "linescout_ml/colab/checkpoints.py; a digest mismatch stops the run (fail closed).",
    "",
    "Fields per artifact:",
    "  id        stable identifier recorded in the run report and the manifest",
    "  group     which loader consumes it (extractor key, encoder key, or 'opennsfw2')",
    "  source    huggingface | url | git   (git = repository code, revision-pinned only)",
    "  repo      Hugging Face repo id or owner/repo for a git source",
    "  revision  immutable commit: a 40-hex SHA, never a branch or tag",
    "  path      filename inside the repo (huggingface/git)",
    "  url       absolute download URL (url)",
    "  sha256    expected digest of the file, or null when the publisher exposes none",
    "  size_bytes  exact byte count; catches a truncated download even when sha256 is null",
    "",
    "Where the publisher publishes no digest (dl.fbaipublicfiles.com, GitHub release",
    "assets) the entry keeps sha256 null and the pipeline *records* the digest it saw",
    "under the cache dir (recorded.json), so the next run verifies against it. Run",
    "`linescout-repro checkpoints verify --policy strict` to refuse any unpinned bytes."
  ],
